COMPILATION OF: E46M29

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M29

   1 a 0000 E46M29:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] RUNTIME: a CHARACTER item beside a FIXED BINARY and
   4 a 0006      a FIXED DECIMAL item in one file PUT, plus a MIXED
   5 a 0006      literal/variable list. P2a pinned each numeric class alone in
   6 a 0006      the file (9 right-justified bytes for both); what is unpinned is
   7 a 0006      the separator before a numeric item that follows a character
   8 a 0006      item. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, k fixed bin(15), z fixed dec(6);
  10 c 0006   v = 'HI';
  11 c 0013   k = 42;
  12 c 0019   z = 123;
  13 c 0029   open file(outf) stream output title('M29OUT DAT');
  14 c 0046   put file(outf) list(v,k,z);
  15 c 007B   put file(outf) list('=',v);
  16 c 009E   close file(outf);
  17 c 00A4   put list('DONE');
  18 c 00BB   stop;
  19 a 00BE end E46M29;

CODE SIZE = 00BE
DATA AREA = 0030
FREE SYMS = 381E
END  COMPILATION
